-- DI CHUYỂN QUA CÁC PHÒNG (Tự động phục hồi tốc độ di chuyển phòng ngay khi player khuất tầm nhìn)
task.spawn(function()
    local function moveToRoom(targetRoom)
        if targetRoom and targetRoom:FindFirstChild("RoomEntrance") then
            while isChasing do task.wait(0.1) end
            if hit or not deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) or isPlayerDead() then return end

            local tween = TweenService:Create(ambush, TweenInfo.new(4, Enum.EasingStyle.Linear), {CFrame = targetRoom.RoomEntrance.CFrame})
            tween:Play()

            while tween.PlaybackState == Enum.PlaybackState.Playing do
                if hit or not deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) or isPlayerDead() then
                    tween:Cancel()
                    return
                end

                if isChasing then
                    tween:Cancel()
                    repeat task.wait(0.1) until not isChasing or hit or not deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) or isPlayerDead()
                    if hit or not deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) or isPlayerDead() then return end

                    -- Ngay khi hết chase (khuất tầm nhìn), lập tức tiếp tục tween bình thường
                    tween = TweenService:Create(ambush, TweenInfo.new(4, Enum.EasingStyle.Linear), {CFrame = targetRoom.RoomEntrance.CFrame})
                    tween:Play()
                end
                task.wait(0.05)
            end
        end
    end

    moveToRoom(room4)
    moveToRoom(room3)
    moveToRoom(room2)
    moveToRoom(room1)
    moveToRoom(room)
    moveToRoom(nextroom)

    if nextroom and nextroom:FindFirstChild("RoomExit") then
        while isChasing do task.wait(0.1) end
        if not hit and deer and deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) and not isPlayerDead() then
            local tweenExit = TweenService:Create(ambush, TweenInfo.new(4, Enum.EasingStyle.Linear), {CFrame = nextroom.RoomExit.CFrame})
            tweenExit:Play()
            tweenExit.Completed:Wait()
        end
    end

    -- Dừng nhạc và Trao thành tựu khi sống sót thành công
    if not hit and deer and deer:IsDescendantOf(Workspace) and not isPlayerDead() then
        pcall(function() deerMusic:Stop() end)
        
        if not _G.DeerGodAchievementGotten then
            _G.DeerGodAchievementGotten = true
            task.spawn(function()
                local success, achievementGiver = pcall(function()
                    return loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RegularVynixu/Utilities/main/Doors/Custom%20Achievements/Source.lua"))()
                end)
                if success and achievementGiver then
                    achievementGiver({
                        Title = "Forest Deity",
                        Desc = "Stared into the eyes of the unknown.",
                        Reason = "Encountered the Deer God",
                        Image = "rbxassetid://114825307168774"
                    })
                end
            end)
        end
        deer:Destroy()
        pcall(function()
            local n = Workspace:FindFirstChild("deerlightnode")
            if n then n:Destroy() end
        end)
    end
end)
